  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Remove wire oven rack from the oven. Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Thinly slice the red onion. Finely chop garlic.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat. Cook onion, stirring regularly, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes. Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-6120079e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the onion is cooking, roughly chop semi-dried tomatoes (see ingredients).\n• In a medium bowl, combine sliced mushrooms, vegetable stock powder, a drizzle of olive oil and a pinch of pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-708f7c3e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Place flatbreads directly on the wire oven rack.\n• Spread pizza sauce evenly across flatbreads using the back of a spoon.\n• Sprinkle over shredded Cheddar cheese. Top with mushrooms and semi-dried tomatoes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-b77dc26d.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake flatbread pizzas until cheese is melted and golden, 12-15 minutes. TIP: Baking the flatbreads directly on the wire racks helps the bases crisp up!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-96d72677.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, thinly slice pear (see ingredients).\n• In a second medium bowl, combine rocket leaves, pear and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Crumble in fetta cubes. Toss to coat. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-00cf7a7b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon caramelised onion over the mushroom and Cheddar flatbread pizza.\n• Divide pizza between plates.\n• Serve with rocket-fetta salad. Enjoy! TIP: Slice the pizza before serving, if you have time!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/628d889b528d7ea6b50c2c26/step-93dffc69.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
